Yes, this is completely clear. Unlike the previous binary/referral matrix project, this is a **Target Savings / Installment Contribution (Hire Purchase / Layaway) E-commerce Portal**.

The operational model is identical to traditional Nigerian thrift and commodity savings schemes: a customer picks a target package (e.g., *₦150k Foodstuff Bundle* or *₦350k Smart TV/Freezer*), chooses a payment schedule (daily, weekly, or monthly), contributes in installments, tracks their running balance, and receives their item once the target is reached.

